# One origin, one session.
#
# Supabase deposits the session in the URL fragment on www, because www is
# the GoTrue Site URL, while every canonical tag, the sitemap and Steam's
# own realm say coldstreamgaming.com. Two origins meant two separate
# localStorage stores: a member could sign in and then look signed out
# simply by typing the address without the www.
#
# So www folds into the apex. A browser reattaches the fragment across a
# redirect when the target carries none of its own, so the access and
# refresh tokens ride this hop intact and the session is created on the
# canonical origin. Steam's own return leg lands on the apex directly and
# never crosses this rule.
https://www.coldstreamgaming.com/* https://coldstreamgaming.com/:splat 301
